<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97463" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύ̆αγρ-ος</span></b> , ὁ, name of
		a dog, <i><span class="en">
			S.
			<u>Fr.</u>
			154
		</span></i>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῦς ἄγριος</span>
			 or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγρία</span>, <i>wild boar</i>
			or <i>sow, wild swine</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				42
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dionys.Trag.
				1.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PRyl.</u>
				238.3
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. ἄρρην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					12.633
				</span></i>
			; un-Attic acc. to <i><span class="en">
				Phryn.
				358
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> name of a
			kind of <i>frankincense</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.68
			</span></i> codd. (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Συάγριος</span> cj.
			Wellmann, i.e. <i>obtained from</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σύαγρος</span>
			<u>in Arabia</u>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> a kind of <i>date</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				13.42
			</span></i>.</div>
